title: '''<mentioned> hides from its link sources <mentioner>'''
pid: b776b129-4f21-4a36-9e6c-e7ace9355d1a
body: |2-
  If I hide a link source from its target,
  it's not obvious that there is any other context
  in which I want that link source hidden.
  Since this is a different treatment,
  it deserves a separate kind of hide relation.
